around 10 to 20 percent of married spouses reporting that they had cheated. And over time, we saw a rise in women's cheating infidelity over time, and men sort of stayed at a similar level. But because it's so hard to define, you could ask, have you ever had sex with someone other than your spouse? Right. You could ask, have you ever cheated on your spouse? And you could get wildly different answers. You could ask the spouse, right? Has your spouse ever cheated on you?

