and you might get a different answer in one direction or the other, whether that's related to knowledge of the infidelity or the definition of infidelity. So we do know that it happens. And we do know that oftentimes, I think the data from national survey from the early 2000 showed that about half of those couples who were married then ended in divorce. But that number is maybe not as high as you would think in some ways, right? that it is not an absolute.

