even though you don't see them in person or see them often, yes, we have the opportunity to day to connect with many, many more people than in prior generations, right? And that could be people that you're meeting. You met at a conference and continue to have some kind of, you know, relationship with via social media or texting or phone calls, right? But don't see that person. It could be an old flame, right? We stay connected to X's. much more today than what was ever possible, right? You can Google, you can be friends on Facebook, you can connect in a multitude of ways with people that you may have known in your past, you may have had a relationship with in your past, or that you may have met only once or not even at all,

