someone may wind up cheating in a relationship. But oftentimes it's really more about the availability of another partner. And that's a little harder to explain in some ways, right, that in fact, it's not just dissatisfied people who cheat in their marriages or in their relationships. It may be that someone else comes along that they are really taken by or that they wind up spending a lot of time with and it slowly develops over time and it may not actually be reflective of being deeply unhappy in their relationship. Now, I will say oftentimes in therapy, if they're coming to therapy, that winds up being part of the narrative because we're trying to explain our own behavior to ourselves in some way. Right. So, well, if I'm cheating, I must be deeply unhappy or angry

