reconnect well with their primary partner. So what we sometimes see in that is if the motivation or the reason or I think it may be more related to the strength or the depth of the connection and the affair, if it's very hard for someone to end, that not only is going to hurt the primary partner more, but it may be that it takes longer for the person participating in the affair to get over it and move on, that there's some real pain that they may be experiencing in that,

