00:14:50.000 --> 00:15:30.000
which their partner, primary partner, is not ever going to understand, right? That's going to be really hard for someone who's been hurt by an affair to understand that the participating partner is also going through some pain and ending the affair. Right. Yes. It'd be pretty hard to say, gee, I feel bad for you. Exactly. We're going to take a short break. When we return, we'll talk about whether psychologists can predict who's likely to cheat and whether there are characteristics or relationship patterns that make infidelity more likely. Now, can you as a psychologist

