have abusive relationships will connect with abusers. Does the same thing happen with cheaters? It does. In fact, some of our work shows just that, that if someone cheated in their last relationship, they're more likely to cheat in their next relationship. This was among unmarried couples. Similarly, if a person was cheated on in their last relationship, they're more likely to be cheated on in their next relationship. And I think part of that second question around, you know, if you were cheated on before or you're more likely to be cheated on again, it's really tragic that that may be the case, right?

