So I think there are some processes that may be hard to undo for people when they've experienced some of those negative kinds of behaviors and experiences in relationships. Speaking of Psychology did an episode earlier this year on chatbot relationships, and there's been a lot of reporting in the mainstream media on people having emotionally intimate relationships with chatbots. Are you encountering this in your practice? And would you think of it as cheating? How do you approach it with couples?

