00:25:21.000 --> 00:25:55.000
What I like about this model is that it also has the overlay of thinking about an affair as trauma. And that's part of what we often see for the person who's been hurt by the affair, is that they have some traumatic responses to it. It might mean not driving by the hotel that you know your partner met the affair partner at, right? It might mean a lot of checking behavior, right? I need to check his phone.

34
