I need to know where she is at every moment. Some of that, I often say, we're just going to do that. We're going to decide to do that for a short period of time. Because in some ways those behaviors can build trust, right? but nobody wants that long term in a relationship. But I think it's a nice way to think about how hurtful it is and that we need reassurance. We're going to go through some waves of, you know, feeling really off because of an affair. And I really like that this model gives us a clear way to progress through treatment after an affair.

